* ''The dogfood proof set'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"1) yes this needs a deterministic set of e2e tests, but please try to find existing ones to update first (hand this design+build to a one-off Luna spirit)."// and //"3) incude this in the dogfood stand/proof. 4) agree, we need the main repo on the full read-to-dogfood stte, then a full rebuild, then a check tht the live Lararium will launch containterized and pono-web3-local-first."//). A deterministic e2e set, built from existing suites first, proves the dogfood stand in CI (lane `dogfood-proof`, a Luna seat). The stand opens only after the main repo reaches the full ready-to-dogfood state, a full rebuild runs, and a check reads the live Lararium launching containerized, web3 and local-first.

